WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
It seems like we all ask for instructions from four people each.

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,080
Two players, two weirdos

3
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:05,320
Have you found any players who share a dormitory with you?

4
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,080
The player in the same dormitory as me died

5
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,160
I'm really convinced

6
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,160
I'm the only human left facing two weirdos

7
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:12,000
Can I change money tonight?

8
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,400
If we get together

9
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:14,800
Isn’t it safe?

10
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,720
You think the rules of revelation are dead

11
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:19,000
Regarding the contract mentioned in the customs clearance conditions

12
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,240
Do you have any clues?

13
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:22,720
You, a new player, still want this?

14
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,820
It would be nice to get out alive

15
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:28,170
Do you have any clues about the contract? I do.

16
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:30,610
But this news I want prop exchange

17
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:32,770
If your message is worth it

18
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:34,980
I'll replace it with a display prop for you

19
00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:38,250
It can alert you to danger

20
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:40,250
The company hired a spy employee before

21
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:42,210
Stole an important contract from BOSS

22
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:44,610
The spy is about to leave with the contract to find the owner in exchange for money.

23
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:45,930
Discovered by BOSS

24
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:47,810
BOSS closes all entrances and exits of the entire building

25
00:00:47,810 --> 00:00:49,690
To catch a spy and retrieve the contract

26
00:00:49,690 --> 00:00:51,370
As a result, the spy jumped directly to his death.

27
00:00:51,370 --> 00:00:52,730
Contracts are not easily broken
